The existing hook is good prose but takes too long to reach the investigation. Creator feedback repeatedly highlights that a slow introduction, unclear package fulfilment or a mismatch between thumbnail expectations and the opening causes early exits; mobile legibility and immediate confirmation matter especially. ([de.reddit.com][8])

